# Part 3: Data Dictionary

---

## 1. FACT_ORDER

**Purpose:** Stores transactional order data and links to related dimension tables.

### Columns

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|------------|----------|-------------|
| order_reference_number | BIGINT | Surrogate key uniquely identifying each order record in the fact table. |
| product_reference_number | BIGINT | Foreign key linking to the DIM_PRODUCT table. |
| campaign_reference_number | BIGINT | Foreign key linking to the DIM_CAMPAIGN table. |
| staff_reference_number | BIGINT | Foreign key linking to the DIM_STAFF table. |
| merchant_reference_number | BIGINT | Foreign key linking to the DIM_MERCHANT table. |
| user_reference_number | BIGINT | Foreign key linking to the DIM_USER table. |
| order_id | TEXT | Original order ID from the source system. |
| order_date | DATE | Date when the order was placed. |
| quantity | DOUBLE PRECISION | Quantity of items ordered. |
| price | DOUBLE PRECISION | Price per item and total price calculation. |
| estimated_arrival | DOUBLE PRECISION | Estimated delivery time. |
| delay_in_days | BIGINT | Number of days the delivery was delayed. |
| availed | TEXT | Indicates whether a promotion or service was availed. |
| transaction_date | DATE | Date when the transaction was completed. |

